    { "a": "warfarin", "b": "st_johns_wort", "severity": "major", "effect": "Induces CYP metabolism and can markedly reduce anticoagulant effect.", "ask": "Ask whether they take St. John's wort -- it can drop the INR and reduce warfarin's protection." },
